SpellDescription,Afflict a targeted enemy within 4 to 7 tiles for 24 turns with Pure damage over time (12/16/20/24 DPS mapped via K_dmg=15) and 16%/19%/22%/25% movement slow; dispelled if the target kills any unit.,
SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells while retaining Ebb & Flow.",
SpellDescription,"Channel on an adjacent foe for 6 turns (7 with Lv 20 talent), stunning it. Each turn deals magical damage of (80/100/120 + 0.3/0.5/0.7 x Pudge's DOTA2-equivalent Strength) x 0.5 / 15 and heals Pudge by the same amount (x1.5 with Lv 25 talent). The channel breaks if Pudge is disabled or the target leaves.",
SpellDescription,"Dispel debuffs and spin for 10 to 12 turns: debuff immunity, 80% magical DR, and 1d4 to 2d4+2 base magical damage per turn (85-205 DPS mapped via K_dmg=15, scaled by DEX & Bladeform attack speed) to adjacent 3x3 foes; can crit with Blade Dance.",
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.",
SpellDescription,"Hurl a bloody hook up to 7 tiles in a direction. It latches onto the first unit in its path and drags it beside Pudge: ordinary monsters are slain outright, unique and guardian foes take 2d6+3 / 4d6+1 / 5d6+2 / 6d6+3 Pure damage (+10 with Lv 15 talent), and allies are pulled without harm.",
SpellDescription,"Launch a surge of water dealing base damage, knocking back, and stunning the target. Bonus damage scales with Agility-to-Strength ratio while stun duration scales with Strength-to-Agility ratio.",
SpellDescription,"Leap to a targeted enemy and unleash 5 to 12 rapid invulnerable weapon slashes (weapon + stat + 2 to 3 bonus damage per slash) across nearby foes, triggering Blade Dance crits and Bladeform bonuses.",
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,
SpellDescription,"Roar to taunt enemies within 2 tiles (3 with Lv 25 talent) for 4 to 6 turns, silencing their spells and forcing them to march and attack Axe while granting +5 to +6 Defence (+7 to +8 with Lv 15 talent).","Roar to taunt enemies within 2 tiles (3 with Lv 25 talent) for 4 to 6 turns, silencing their spells and forcing them to march and attack Axe while granting +5 to +6 Defense (+7 to +8 with Lv 15 talent)."
SpellDescription,"Shift Agility into Strength and Constitution (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats while raising both maximum and current HP.",
SpellDescription,"Shift Strength and Constitution into Agility (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats and lowering maximum HP without draining current HP.",
SpellDescription,"Strike a nearby foe (range 2) with Pure force: instantly executes targets at or below 18/25/32 HP (+mastery/talent), refunding 100% mana, granting nearby allies +25% move speed and +4/+6/+7 Defence for 12 turns, and stacking permanent armor; otherwise deals 5d6+1 to 9d6 Pure damage.","Strike a nearby foe (range 2) with Pure force: instantly executes targets at or below 18/25/32 HP (+mastery/talent), refunding 100% mana, granting nearby allies +25% move speed and +4/+6/+7 Defense for 12 turns, and stacking permanent armor; otherwise deals 5d6+1 to 9d6 Pure damage."
SpellDescription,"Summon a fragile movable Healing Ward (1 HP, max 1 active) for 36 to 48 turns that heals all allies within 2 tiles for 1% to 3.25% of their maximum HP each turn.",
SpellDescription,"Toggle a cloud of toxic gas around Pudge (free). Each turn it deals 1/2/3/4 magical damage to adjacent foes and to Pudge himself, and slows foes by 14%/20%/26%/32%. Rot can never reduce Pudge below 1 HP, and Meat Shield blocks its self-damage per DOTA2 tick.",
SpellDescription,Wrap Pudge in a layer of flesh for 8/10/12/14 turns. Every instance of damage of any type is reduced by 0.53/0.93/1.33/1.73 on average (the fraction rounds up by chance; x1.5 with Lv 25 talent). Cannot be dispelled.,
